            "target_entity_instance": "Atlantic Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "A wider perspective can include a description of climate surprises that could plausibly be generated by nonlinear feedbacks, for example a description of the effect of a collapse of the thermohaline circulation in the Atlantic Ocean, or disruption of the monsoon circulation.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
